{"id":"e1876c63cf3f1fb2","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-redex.md","title":"Redex","display":"df-redex — Redex","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-redex","aliases":["72-df-redex"],"display":"df-redex — Redex","depends_on":["[[72-df-curry-howard]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, §3.3 print17–20; §11.6 print93","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-redex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-redex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-redex — Redex"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4628a763a7cdff3f\" href=\"?note=4628a763a7cdff3f\" title=\"72-df-curry-howard\">72-df-curry-howard</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, §3.3 print17–20; §11.6 print93"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4628a763a7cdff3f\" href=\"?note=4628a763a7cdff3f\" title=\"72-df-curry-howard\">72-df-curry-howard</a> 的原始证明树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span>、证明绑定等价 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_s^\\alpha\">\\(\\sim_s^\\alpha\\)</span>、商集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_s\">\\(\\mathcal D_s\\)</span> 及原始构造标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}\">\\(s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathcal D_s\">\\(d\\in\\mathcal D_s\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,t\\in\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(r,t\\in\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(o\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_t\">\\(x\\in V_t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in V_T\">\\(U\\in V_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span>。位置与子树的递归只作用于原始树；子树算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r|_o^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(r|_o^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)\">\\(o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i^{\\mathrm r},I^{\\mathrm r},E^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(i^{\\mathrm r},I^{\\mathrm r},E^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span> 各有一个证明子项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(e^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span> 有两个；类型注解不是证明子项。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_\\to\">\\(\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_\\to\\)</span> 的项级形状检验也可作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_F\">\\(\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_F\\)</span> 只用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=F\">\\(s=F\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 是原始代表的非空等价类；下式通过所有代表的同一位置集合定义商上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos},\\operatorname{Redex}_s,\\operatorname{Detour}_s\">\\(\\operatorname{Pos},\\operatorname{Redex}_s,\\operatorname{Detour}_s\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(a^{\\mathrm r}(x))&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,r))&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(I^{\\mathrm r}(U,r))&amp;:=\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(E^{\\mathrm r}(r,A)):=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(e^{\\mathrm r}(r,t))&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle1\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(t)\\},\\\\\nr|_{\\langle\\rangle}^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=r,\\\\\ni^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,r)|_{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=r|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\qquad\nI^{\\mathrm r}(U,r)|_{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}:=r|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\\\\nE^{\\mathrm r}(r,A)|_{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=r|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\\\\ne^{\\mathrm r}(r,t)|_{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=r|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\qquad\ne^{\\mathrm r}(r,t)|_{\\langle1\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}:=t|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_\\to(r)&amp;:=\\{o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r):\\exists x\\in V_t\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to^{\\mathrm r}\\cup\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\ \\exists r_0,r_1\\in\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r}\\cup\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r}\\ (r|_o^{\\mathrm r}=e^{\\mathrm r}(i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,r_0),r_1))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_F(r)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_\\to(r)\\cup\\{o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r):\\exists U\\in V_T\\ \\exists r_0\\in\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r}\\ \\exists B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\ (r|_o^{\\mathrm r}=E^{\\mathrm r}(I^{\\mathrm r}(U,r_0),B))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(a^{\\mathrm r}(x))&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,r))&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(I^{\\mathrm r}(U,r))&amp;:=\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(E^{\\mathrm r}(r,A)):=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(e^{\\mathrm r}(r,t))&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle1\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(t)\\},\\\\\nr|_{\\langle\\rangle}^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=r,\\\\\ni^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,r)|_{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=r|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\qquad\nI^{\\mathrm r}(U,r)|_{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}:=r|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\\\\nE^{\\mathrm r}(r,A)|_{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=r|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\\\\ne^{\\mathrm r}(r,t)|_{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=r|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\qquad\ne^{\\mathrm r}(r,t)|_{\\langle1\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}:=t|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_\\to(r)&amp;:=\\{o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r):\\exists x\\in V_t\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to^{\\mathrm r}\\cup\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\ \\exists r_0,r_1\\in\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r}\\cup\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r}\\ (r|_o^{\\mathrm r}=e^{\\mathrm r}(i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,r_0),r_1))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_F(r)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_\\to(r)\\cup\\{o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r):\\exists U\\in V_T\\ \\exists r_0\\in\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r}\\ \\exists B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\ (r|_o^{\\mathrm r}=E^{\\mathrm r}(I^{\\mathrm r}(U,r_0),B))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nr\\sim_s^\\alpha t&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)=\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(t)\\land\n\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_s(r)=\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_s(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}(d)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{r\\in d}\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d):=\\bigcup_{r\\in d}\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_s(r),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Detour}_s(o,d)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow o\\in\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d),\\qquad\n\\#\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d):=|\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d)|.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nr\\sim_s^\\alpha t&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)=\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(t)\\land\n\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_s(r)=\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_s(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}(d)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{r\\in d}\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d):=\\bigcup_{r\\in d}\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_s(r),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Detour}_s(o,d)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow o\\in\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d),\\qquad\n\\#\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d):=|\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d)|.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>绑定改名保持每个构造标签及证明子项地址，因此位置集和两种 detour 形状检验在所有代表上相同；它们可以下降到商。原始子树本身不能直接下降：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i(x,A,a(x))\">\\(i(x,A,a(x))\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i(y,A,a(y))\">\\(i(y,A,a(y))\\)</span> 可为同一绑定类，而体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(x)\">\\(a(x)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(y)\">\\(a(y)\\)</span> 含不同自由变量。这里将子树提取留在原始树上，只把代表不变的位置集合公开为原有的 Redex、Detour 接口。范围仍限于蕴含及二阶命题全称的 introduction–elimination detour。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-curry-howard","status":"resolved","id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-curry-howard]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-curry-howard","status":"resolved","id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-curry-howard]] 的原始证明树 $\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}$、证明绑定等价 $\\sim_s^\\alpha$、商集 $\\mathcal D_s$ 及原始构造标签；$s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}$，$d\\in\\mathcal D_s$，$r,t\\in\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim_s^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_s","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\mathcal D_s","display":false},{"tex":"r,t\\in\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"o\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_t","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in V_T","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"r|_o^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)","display":false},{"tex":"i^{\\mathrm r},I^{\\mathrm r},E^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"e^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_F","display":false},{"tex":"s=F","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pos},\\operatorname{Redex}_s,\\operatorname{Detour}_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(a^{\\mathrm r}(x))&:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,r))&:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(I^{\\mathrm r}(U,r))&:=\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(E^{\\mathrm r}(r,A)):=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(e^{\\mathrm r}(r,t))&:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle1\\rangle^\\frown o:o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(t)\\},\\\\\nr|_{\\langle\\rangle}^{\\mathrm r}&:=r,\\\\\ni^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,r)|_{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}&:=r|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\qquad\nI^{\\mathrm r}(U,r)|_{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}:=r|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\\\\nE^{\\mathrm r}(r,A)|_{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}&:=r|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\\\\ne^{\\mathrm r}(r,t)|_{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}&:=r|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\qquad\ne^{\\mathrm r}(r,t)|_{\\langle1\\rangle^\\frown o}^{\\mathrm r}:=t|_o^{\\mathrm r},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_\\to(r)&:=\\{o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r):\\exists x\\in V_t\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to^{\\mathrm r}\\cup\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\ \\exists r_0,r_1\\in\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r}\\cup\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r}\\ (r|_o^{\\mathrm r}=e^{\\mathrm r}(i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,r_0),r_1))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_F(r)&:=\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_\\to(r)\\cup\\{o\\in\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r):\\exists U\\in V_T\\ \\exists r_0\\in\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r}\\ \\exists B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\ (r|_o^{\\mathrm r}=E^{\\mathrm r}(I^{\\mathrm r}(U,r_0),B))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nr\\sim_s^\\alpha t&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r)=\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(t)\\land\n\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_s(r)=\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_s(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}(d)&:=\\bigcup_{r\\in d}\\operatorname{Pos}^{\\mathrm r}(r),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d):=\\bigcup_{r\\in d}\\operatorname{Rdx}^{\\mathrm r}_s(r),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Detour}_s(o,d)&:\\Longleftrightarrow o\\in\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d),\\qquad\n\\#\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d):=|\\operatorname{Redex}_s(d)|.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"i(x,A,a(x))","display":false},{"tex":"i(y,A,a(y))","display":false},{"tex":"a(x)","display":false},{"tex":"a(y)","display":false}],"bytes":4337,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-453","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-redex|df-redex — Redex]]"}],"outgoing":["4628a763a7cdff3f"]}